// Privacy notice for the Ino Loyalty apps on Shopify and ikas (URLs entered in the app store listings).
// ikas: the app connects the store to the merchant's Ino Loyalty program (engine model). Source: Ino-Loyalty-NET
// docs/shopify-store/privacy-policy.md, docs/KVKK_VERI_ENVANTERI.md and the ikas connector scopes.
// Shopify: the standalone app on the Shop Engine, plus connected mode (further down, `shopify`). Source: Ino-Loyalty-NET
// docs/shopify-store/protected-customer-data-standalone.md §3, docs/shopify-store/privacy-shopify-app.md,
// docs/kvkk/veri-envanteri.json (ino-shop-engine, ino-connect rows) and docs/SHOPIFY_CONNECTED.md. Checked 2026-11-06.
